{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C3\", \"C2\", \"C1\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C2最均衡，既保留了v6的核心愿望，也让尚未得到回应的期待在狂喜当下仍然存在，最能解释音乐中饱满与牵引并存的状态。keep：C2明确保留积攒的关心、想被珍惜、许多爱可以给、许多真情值得珍惜以及没有新保证等内容；C1次之，C3则遗漏了许多感情值得珍惜和较完整的给予感。cover：C3以旧日难堪退下、顾不上自己的得失解释自我为何暂时退居后面，又以仍盼对方选择自己解释狂喜中的未满足；C2接近，但对自我退开的解释较少，C1则把未回应的期待推迟到欢喜消退之后，较难解释段内持续的牵引。lean：C2的心理推进较短，四步之间衔接清楚；C1对亲近和想关心对方的动因略有重复，C3又增加了旧日难堪和得失两层心理说明。plain：C1的好好关心对方、看看两个人能过怎样的日子最像一个人在讲自己的事；C2稍有概括性，C3的旧日难堪退下、欢喜浓得难以承受更像对心理状态的归纳。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ab9fd98a-6802-4793-b17b-7eb070fb2b39", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T230747733786Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.0, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:08:53.730930+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "756a4480d6f32ff849287f0ab7b89f903f9031f2adf09f153151505e53c8ebc4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948